#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/wuyun.md:14
msgid "美式的牛仔和中式的牛仔（康巴汉子元素）结合，可考虑头戴棕色牛仔帽，穿红色披肩，上面绣黄色花纹。上衣穿淡蓝色衬衫，外面搭配灰色马甲，腰间佩戴棕色宽腰带，腰带上搭配左轮枪套。下身穿黑色长裤，搭配马靴。面部是络腮胡。详见参考图。"
msgstr "A blend of American cowboy and Chinese cowboy (Khampa man elements). Consider wearing a brown cowboy hat, a red cape with yellow embroidered patterns. Light blue shirt with a gray vest over it, brown wide belt at the waist with a revolver holster attached. Black pants with riding boots. Full beard on the face. See reference images for details."

